1
00:02:26,664 --> 00:02:28,874
Previously on Dating Alys Perez.

2
00:02:29,229 --> 00:02:31,311
Cristine and I aren't the same size.

3
00:02:32,003 --> 00:02:33,838
Are you calling yourself fat?

4
00:02:35,065 --> 00:02:36,275
Excuse me?!

5
00:02:36,300 --> 00:02:38,509
Ms. Alys, the gown might get damaged!

6
00:02:38,816 --> 00:02:39,901
Shut up!

7
00:02:40,067 --> 00:02:41,652
On the count of three,
you're gonna zip it up.

8
00:02:41,677 --> 00:02:44,055
No matter what happens,
even if it gets torn, I don’t care!

9
00:02:44,080 --> 00:02:45,372
You and Tripp,

10
00:02:45,397 --> 00:02:46,607
good together.

11
00:02:48,363 --> 00:02:49,447
You and Drake,

12
00:02:49,752 --> 00:02:50,794
epic!

13
00:02:52,690 --> 00:02:54,525
Can you feel that, Alys?

14
00:02:54,665 --> 00:02:56,792
God, it's so pretty!

15
00:02:56,817 --> 00:02:59,528
You'll drop dead when
you see Alys in this!

16
00:03:00,581 --> 00:03:02,208
She's always beautiful.

17
00:03:02,770 --> 00:03:05,940
That's the heartbeat of a man
who's obsessed with you.

18
00:03:06,112 --> 00:03:07,363
When's the proposal?

19
00:03:07,761 --> 00:03:09,013
Proposal?

20
00:03:10,381 --> 00:03:11,674
The day before the wedding.

21
00:03:11,838 --> 00:03:13,298
Now it's up to Alys.

22
00:03:13,586 --> 00:03:15,588
If she'll say yes.

23
00:03:15,671 --> 00:03:16,648
She will.

24
00:04:04,387 --> 00:04:05,269
Tripp.

25
00:04:06,495 --> 00:04:07,316
Hey, Silly!

26
00:04:09,809 --> 00:04:10,668
Hey.

27
00:04:12,520 --> 00:04:13,480
What happened?

28
00:04:14,318 --> 00:04:15,348
Why are you crying?

29
00:04:16,857 --> 00:04:17,855
Hold on.

30
00:04:18,140 --> 00:04:19,191
Let me get you some water.

31
00:04:21,171 --> 00:04:22,137
Wait, Zy.

32
00:04:41,090 --> 00:04:42,091
Feel better?

33
00:04:43,843 --> 00:04:44,595
Tell me.

34
00:04:45,302 --> 00:04:46,228
What's wrong?

35
00:04:55,521 --> 00:04:56,733
I'm sorry.

36
00:04:59,692 --> 00:05:00,740
Sorry for what?

37
00:05:01,701 --> 00:05:02,952
What's the matter?

38
00:05:04,697 --> 00:05:06,449
Please don't be mad.

39
00:05:12,371 --> 00:05:13,789
Is this about Drake again?

40
00:05:19,474 --> 00:05:20,433
But please,

41
00:05:21,021 --> 00:05:22,756
listen to me first.

42
00:05:23,257 --> 00:05:24,248
Okay?

43
00:05:29,528 --> 00:05:30,584
I...

44
00:05:31,682 --> 00:05:32,933
I overheard

45
00:05:33,449 --> 00:05:34,700
him say...

46
00:05:37,086 --> 00:05:39,213
that he's proposing to me.

47
00:05:40,399 --> 00:05:41,319
Huh?!

48
00:05:42,359 --> 00:05:43,373
What?!

49
00:05:46,113 --> 00:05:47,615
Marco, please calm down!

50
00:05:47,615 --> 00:05:49,950
Listen to me first, please?

51
00:05:51,381 --> 00:05:52,966
Do you remember...

52
00:05:53,954 --> 00:05:57,124
Do you remember
Cristine and Drake's wedding?

53
00:05:57,184 --> 00:05:58,767
It turns out it was meant for us.

54
00:05:58,792 --> 00:06:01,311
I'm sorry, I really didn't know!

55
00:06:01,837 --> 00:06:02,678
Marco —

56
00:06:03,047 --> 00:06:04,590
Motherfucker!

57
00:06:05,635 --> 00:06:06,733
I'll kill him!

58
00:06:07,723 --> 00:06:09,058
I'll kill that shit!

59
00:06:10,054 --> 00:06:11,847
Marco, please...

60
00:06:12,056 --> 00:06:13,974
Marco, please, Marco...

61
00:06:13,974 --> 00:06:15,184
Zy!

62
00:06:16,166 --> 00:06:17,459
Stop it!

63
00:06:17,484 --> 00:06:18,902
Don't touch me!

64
00:06:20,704 --> 00:06:21,789
Damn it!

65
00:06:27,668 --> 00:06:30,171
Please, Marco, calm down.
Don't get mad.

66
00:06:30,658 --> 00:06:33,244
- You know I would never—
- Don't get mad?!

67
00:06:33,365 --> 00:06:35,200
Don't get mad, Zy?!

68
00:06:35,688 --> 00:06:37,065
Just think for a second!

69
00:06:38,188 --> 00:06:39,523
How can I not be angry?!

70
00:06:40,634 --> 00:06:42,594
He wants to propose to my girlfriend!

71
00:06:43,644 --> 00:06:45,229
My girlfriend, Zy!

72
00:06:46,222 --> 00:06:47,682
My girlfriend!

73
00:06:47,972 --> 00:06:49,891
That shit wants to marry her!

74
00:06:50,652 --> 00:06:52,404
What do you expect me to do?
Celebrate?

75
00:06:53,689 --> 00:06:55,190
Come on, think!

76
00:06:55,881 --> 00:06:57,924
Marco, I would never
accept his proposal.

77
00:06:57,949 --> 00:07:00,452
You know that you're
the only one I love.

78
00:07:07,243 --> 00:07:08,787
I know you love me, Zy.

79
00:07:09,196 --> 00:07:10,701
You always say that.

80
00:07:12,694 --> 00:07:14,071
But tell me the truth.

81
00:07:15,411 --> 00:07:16,694
Am I really the only one you love?

82
00:07:18,986 --> 00:07:20,311
Answer me!

83
00:07:22,018 --> 00:07:23,103
Is it just me?

84
00:07:24,693 --> 00:07:26,278
Of course, Tripp!

85
00:07:26,380 --> 00:07:27,965
Why would you ask me that?

86
00:07:27,965 --> 00:07:29,758
You're the only one I love.

87
00:07:31,969 --> 00:07:33,262
Then, why?

88
00:07:34,687 --> 00:07:36,856
No matter how many
times you say it,

89
00:07:37,672 --> 00:07:39,436
I can still feel something’s off.

90
00:07:40,524 --> 00:07:41,566
Like...

91
00:07:42,461 --> 00:07:44,838
why do I still feel like
I’m just a rebound?

92
00:07:46,460 --> 00:07:49,754
The moment Drake shows up,
that’ll be it.

93
00:07:50,654 --> 00:07:52,280
You'll just throw me away!

94
00:07:53,282 --> 00:07:54,700
Tripp, please!

95
00:07:58,078 --> 00:07:59,788
I'm right, aren't I?

96
00:08:01,790 --> 00:08:04,501
I don't know why I'm like this, Zy.

97
00:08:06,086 --> 00:08:07,004
I know...

98
00:08:07,921 --> 00:08:11,967
what we have will never compare
to what you and Drake have.

99
00:08:12,885 --> 00:08:14,011
Do you know why?

100
00:08:15,679 --> 00:08:16,722
What am I, anyway?

101
00:08:18,390 --> 00:08:19,850
I'm just a rebound!

102
00:08:20,851 --> 00:08:21,769
Forced!

103
00:08:21,935 --> 00:08:23,270
We forced ourselves together.

104
00:08:24,438 --> 00:08:25,064
Us.

105
00:08:26,815 --> 00:08:28,442
There was never an us!

106
00:08:29,818 --> 00:08:31,320
Tripp, don't say that!

107
00:08:31,737 --> 00:08:32,613
We're nothing!

108
00:08:32,613 --> 00:08:35,115
Don't say that, Tripp, please!

109
00:08:35,407 --> 00:08:37,451
I was after you...

110
00:08:37,451 --> 00:08:39,703
for two years, Zy!

111
00:08:40,245 --> 00:08:43,028
Two years.
It was all hard work, all genuine!

112
00:08:44,792 --> 00:08:46,184
All for nothing!

113
00:08:46,960 --> 00:08:48,921
Nothing I do will ever compare
to what you and Drake have.

114
00:08:48,921 --> 00:08:50,172
I know that!

115
00:08:50,839 --> 00:08:51,723
I’m such an idiot!

116
00:08:53,884 --> 00:08:56,011
If I never cared about you,

117
00:08:57,241 --> 00:09:00,953
then I would have married
Drake a long time ago.

118
00:09:01,308 --> 00:09:02,851
But I'm here, aren't I?

119
00:09:02,851 --> 00:09:04,978
I am with you, Tripp.
I'm here with you.

120
00:09:04,978 --> 00:09:06,230
I'm trying to fix this.

121
00:09:06,230 --> 00:09:08,565
What else do I have to do?!

122
00:09:09,053 --> 00:09:10,054
It hurts.

123
00:09:10,567 --> 00:09:12,176
But you know what really hurts?

124
00:09:14,634 --> 00:09:15,885
What I feel right now.

125
00:09:17,658 --> 00:09:18,909
You know what really hurts?

126
00:09:19,827 --> 00:09:21,746
The fact that I could do everything,

127
00:09:23,455 --> 00:09:24,832
and none of it will matter.

128
00:09:25,647 --> 00:09:27,482
None of it will matter
because I came late!

129
00:09:28,043 --> 00:09:31,839
What do I have to do
to prove to you that I love you?

130
00:09:31,839 --> 00:09:33,465
And you're the only one I love!

131
00:09:37,636 --> 00:09:38,887
Marry me.

132
00:09:40,793 --> 00:09:42,920
Marry me and I'll be at peace.

133
00:09:43,482 --> 00:09:44,442
That's it.

134
00:09:45,166 --> 00:09:46,542
That's all I need.

135
00:09:49,459 --> 00:09:50,324
So?

136
00:09:50,988 --> 00:09:51,895
That's all.

137
00:09:56,238 --> 00:09:57,197
Tripp...

138
00:09:58,488 --> 00:09:59,447
There it is!

139
00:09:59,856 --> 00:10:00,815
That's it!

140
00:10:01,133 --> 00:10:02,778
That's where we always end up.

141
00:10:02,803 --> 00:10:03,929
With Drake!

142
00:10:05,298 --> 00:10:06,757
It will always be Drake!

143
00:10:11,378 --> 00:10:12,473
I knew it!

144
00:10:13,297 --> 00:10:15,048
Tripp, enough with Drake,

145
00:10:15,048 --> 00:10:15,841
I'm here!

146
00:10:15,841 --> 00:10:18,635
I am trying to fix this.
But you keep going back to Drake.

147
00:10:18,635 --> 00:10:20,596
Let's fix this, please!

148
00:10:21,180 --> 00:10:22,723
I'm trying to explain myself,

149
00:10:22,723 --> 00:10:24,934
- but you're being a fucking asshole!
- I’m done!

150
00:10:25,309 --> 00:10:26,560
An asshole?

151
00:10:26,810 --> 00:10:28,395
<i>God, what's happening?</i>

152
00:10:28,395 --> 00:10:30,522
<i>Where is the Tripp I know?</i>

153
00:10:30,522 --> 00:10:32,191
<i>The Tripp that's always calm?</i>

154
00:10:32,566 --> 00:10:34,403
Four years!

155
00:10:35,402 --> 00:10:36,987
Four fucking years!

156
00:10:36,987 --> 00:10:38,832
I let myself be a fool for you!

157
00:10:39,323 --> 00:10:42,409
Haven't I earned a
moment to be the asshole?

158
00:10:44,219 --> 00:10:45,473
Just this once!

159
00:10:49,614 --> 00:10:50,532
Get out of here.

160
00:10:50,557 --> 00:10:51,891
Please, I'm begging you.

161
00:10:51,916 --> 00:10:53,168
- No.
- Just leave.

162
00:10:53,212 --> 00:10:54,285
I don't want to.

163
00:10:54,364 --> 00:10:55,531
We’ll just end up fighting, Zy.

164
00:10:55,556 --> 00:10:56,582
Leave!

165
00:10:57,674 --> 00:10:58,300
Leave!

166
00:10:58,300 --> 00:11:01,053
- Please, Tripp, I'm sorry.
- Please, please!

167
00:11:01,053 --> 00:11:03,639
- Please!
- Please, Tripp, I'm sorry.

168
00:11:03,639 --> 00:11:04,556
Leave!

169
00:11:04,556 --> 00:11:05,390
I don't want to!

170
00:11:05,390 --> 00:11:06,725
Just leave.

171
00:11:07,048 --> 00:11:08,758
Leave!

172
00:11:09,436 --> 00:11:11,480
You threw it all away!

173
00:11:29,373 --> 00:11:30,749
Fuck!

174
00:13:35,791 --> 00:13:36,732
Drake.

175
00:13:40,253 --> 00:13:42,756
Just stop this already, will you?

176
00:13:46,301 --> 00:13:47,678
I'm so tired of this.

177
00:13:53,339 --> 00:13:56,050
You're making this hard for me.

178
00:13:58,522 --> 00:13:59,523
What?

179
00:14:00,691 --> 00:14:02,067
All of this.

180
00:14:03,485 --> 00:14:04,861
Stop it.

181
00:14:05,782 --> 00:14:06,952
The chasing.

182
00:14:07,280 --> 00:14:08,448
The begging.

183
00:14:08,550 --> 00:14:09,686
The hurting.

184
00:14:11,451 --> 00:14:12,577
Just stop it.

185
00:14:22,363 --> 00:14:24,031
What if I don't want to, Alys?

186
00:14:25,465 --> 00:14:27,050
Drake, please.

187
00:14:28,051 --> 00:14:29,219
Please!

188
00:14:30,762 --> 00:14:32,764
Enough, please.

189
00:14:33,747 --> 00:14:36,592
Alys, I don't believe you.

190
00:14:40,397 --> 00:14:41,256
Drake,

191
00:14:42,547 --> 00:14:44,132
if you still love me,

192
00:14:46,012 --> 00:14:47,346
stop it, please.

193
00:14:48,572 --> 00:14:49,781
Please.

194
00:14:51,658 --> 00:14:52,868
Please.

195
00:14:53,779 --> 00:14:55,029
I wish I could.

196
00:14:57,725 --> 00:14:59,458
But I can't, Alys.

197
00:14:59,934 --> 00:15:01,185
I don't want to.

198
00:15:03,462 --> 00:15:04,588
I don't want to.

199
00:15:05,380 --> 00:15:06,548
Enough.

200
00:15:07,758 --> 00:15:09,209
Enough!

201
00:15:09,687 --> 00:15:11,188
Stop begging me, Drake!

202
00:15:12,455 --> 00:15:16,125
Even if you cry, beg
and kneel before me,

203
00:15:17,309 --> 00:15:19,478
there’s nothing left I can give you.

204
00:15:21,438 --> 00:15:22,779
Nothing!

205
00:15:24,066 --> 00:15:26,610
I've given it all to Tripp!

206
00:15:26,902 --> 00:15:28,686
Do you think I wanted this?!

207
00:15:29,446 --> 00:15:30,467
Alys!

208
00:15:32,042 --> 00:15:35,170
Do you think I enjoy being a fool?!

209
00:15:38,286 --> 00:15:39,717
No, Alys!

210
00:15:40,780 --> 00:15:42,282
You're tired?!

211
00:15:45,462 --> 00:15:46,334
Fine.

212
00:15:47,672 --> 00:15:49,049
I hurt you.

213
00:15:50,801 --> 00:15:51,927
Sure.

214
00:15:53,293 --> 00:15:57,922
But Alys, even just once,
did you ever ask me how I was?

215
00:16:00,227 --> 00:16:03,115
You have no idea
what I've been through, Alys.

216
00:16:05,607 --> 00:16:06,990
You know nothing.

217
00:16:10,254 --> 00:16:12,173
I left you, that's true.

218
00:16:12,614 --> 00:16:15,575
Alys, those moments haunt me
every single night.

219
00:16:15,992 --> 00:16:19,746
Every fucking night, I wanted to
fly to New York and apologize to you.

220
00:16:22,332 --> 00:16:23,873
But you don't know anything.

221
00:16:23,925 --> 00:16:25,677
Who am I, anyway, Alys?

222
00:16:25,702 --> 00:16:26,952
Right?

223
00:16:31,485 --> 00:16:34,488
Do you know how much I cried
when I found out about you and Tripp?

224
00:16:36,888 --> 00:16:39,045
Even my dad hated you, Alys.

225
00:16:40,229 --> 00:16:42,774
It was always about you.

226
00:16:43,937 --> 00:16:45,553
What about me?

227
00:16:48,900 --> 00:16:50,178
And yes,

228
00:16:50,394 --> 00:16:52,076
call me pathetic, Alys.

229
00:16:56,131 --> 00:16:58,443
I had no one, then.

230
00:16:59,651 --> 00:17:02,946
You had Tripp and Tofer.

231
00:17:05,750 --> 00:17:07,201
It's not fair.

232
00:17:08,712 --> 00:17:10,589
You were so unfair, Alys.

233
00:17:14,259 --> 00:17:16,720
You spent years hating me.

234
00:17:17,011 --> 00:17:21,057
While I spent years wishing
you'd come back to me.

235
00:17:24,811 --> 00:17:26,756
Fine, call me pathetic.

236
00:17:28,815 --> 00:17:30,357
I don't know anymore.

237
00:17:34,487 --> 00:17:37,157
I'm so confused, Drake.

238
00:17:40,008 --> 00:17:41,107
Please.

239
00:17:43,496 --> 00:17:45,415
Please stop this.

240
00:17:50,587 --> 00:17:51,922
Alys.

241
00:17:58,491 --> 00:18:00,160
The wedding is in two days.

242
00:18:03,034 --> 00:18:04,702
You can marry me

243
00:18:04,851 --> 00:18:06,394
or lose me forever.

244
00:18:09,895 --> 00:18:11,318
For the last time,

245
00:18:12,317 --> 00:18:13,857
I'll be pathetic.

246
00:18:39,087 --> 00:18:40,623
Aww, baby.

247
00:18:42,055 --> 00:18:43,932
What happened?

248
00:18:45,600 --> 00:18:48,201
It really hurts, Mommy.

249
00:18:48,936 --> 00:18:50,982
Is this about the cousins?

250
00:18:56,395 --> 00:18:59,064
I don’t want to hurt them, Mommy.

251
00:18:59,197 --> 00:19:00,232
Oh.

252
00:19:01,291 --> 00:19:02,834
I know, baby.

253
00:19:04,119 --> 00:19:07,163
You can't escape the pain,

254
00:19:07,281 --> 00:19:09,908
by avoiding to make a decision.

255
00:19:10,333 --> 00:19:13,044
The days just kept getting longer.

256
00:19:15,278 --> 00:19:16,529
Baby,

257
00:19:16,554 --> 00:19:19,140
you have to ask yourself.

258
00:19:20,334 --> 00:19:21,592
What if

259
00:19:22,345 --> 00:19:24,180
you lose both of them?

260
00:19:25,182 --> 00:19:27,434
Who would be the
first person you'd look for?

261
00:19:28,405 --> 00:19:30,991
Who is the one
you could never let go of?

262
00:19:41,270 --> 00:19:42,098
Alys.

263
00:19:43,348 --> 00:19:44,208
Alys, get up.

264
00:19:45,884 --> 00:19:46,885
Get up!

265
00:19:47,495 --> 00:19:48,455
What?

266
00:19:48,455 --> 00:19:50,540
Tripp and Drake are downstairs.

267
00:19:51,582 --> 00:19:52,666
What?!

268
00:19:52,691 --> 00:19:53,776
Get up!

269
00:20:20,904 --> 00:20:22,848
Should I face them or not?

270
00:20:24,866 --> 00:20:27,285
I just finished crying,
and now this again?

271
00:20:27,660 --> 00:20:30,622
Can't I get a time out and rest?

272
00:20:31,539 --> 00:20:33,875
My heart hurts so much.

273
00:20:42,467 --> 00:20:43,343
- Alys.
- Alys.

274
00:20:43,468 --> 00:20:45,470
You two, just stop already!

275
00:20:45,470 --> 00:20:47,138
Would you let me rest?

276
00:20:50,767 --> 00:20:51,810
Tripp?

277
00:20:52,727 --> 00:20:54,104
What happened to you?

278
00:20:58,441 --> 00:21:00,652
I'm protecting what's mine.

279
00:21:02,737 --> 00:21:03,780
Drake, what did you —

280
00:21:08,451 --> 00:21:09,577
Drake...

281
00:21:11,621 --> 00:21:14,124
I'm just wondering
how it would feel

282
00:21:15,291 --> 00:21:17,377
seeing you take care of him.

283
00:21:18,253 --> 00:21:20,713
Alys, we're both hurt.

284
00:21:21,506 --> 00:21:23,675
I thought this would hurt more.

285
00:21:24,092 --> 00:21:26,136
But, Alys I feel nothing.

286
00:21:26,594 --> 00:21:28,638
You've made me numb.

287
00:21:31,349 --> 00:21:32,642
- Drake...
- Alys!

288
00:21:33,893 --> 00:21:34,644
Don't.

289
00:21:35,353 --> 00:21:36,289
Please.

290
00:21:37,355 --> 00:21:38,356
Stay with me.

291
00:21:39,357 --> 00:21:40,358
Please!

292
00:21:41,776 --> 00:21:42,777
Please!

293
00:21:47,115 --> 00:21:48,450
Tripp, come on.

294
00:21:49,033 --> 00:21:50,492
Just this once.

295
00:21:50,760 --> 00:21:52,762
Show him that I’m your priority.

296
00:21:53,486 --> 00:21:54,367
Please!

297
00:21:55,712 --> 00:21:57,005
All my life, Zy.

298
00:21:58,251 --> 00:22:00,044
I always come second.

299
00:22:01,546 --> 00:22:02,797
Please!

300
00:22:03,047 --> 00:22:05,884
Just this once,
let my feelings come first.

301
00:22:16,853 --> 00:22:17,586
Tripp.

302
00:22:18,885 --> 00:22:21,471
You know, I always put you first.

303
00:22:21,816 --> 00:22:23,485
Just this once, please.

304
00:22:23,776 --> 00:22:25,862
I need to speak to Drake.

305
00:22:26,654 --> 00:22:27,780
Alys,

306
00:22:27,780 --> 00:22:29,240
I know you love me.

307
00:22:31,034 --> 00:22:33,453
But I know you still love Drake.

308
00:22:34,329 --> 00:22:37,207
And I'm okay with you loving us both.

309
00:22:40,001 --> 00:22:41,878
There's only one thing I ask of you.

310
00:22:42,629 --> 00:22:44,631
Love me a little more.

311
00:22:45,507 --> 00:22:46,591
Just a little.

312
00:22:50,678 --> 00:22:51,763
Please, Zy.

313
00:22:52,347 --> 00:22:53,264
I'm begging you.

314
00:22:55,934 --> 00:22:56,954
Please.

315
00:22:59,103 --> 00:23:00,271
I can't do this anymore.

316
00:23:01,851 --> 00:23:02,769
I give up.

317
00:23:03,983 --> 00:23:05,743
Forget about the wedding, Alys.

318
00:23:16,162 --> 00:23:17,789
Nanny, thank you.

319
00:23:19,155 --> 00:23:20,072
Nanny!

320
00:23:20,097 --> 00:23:21,474
Yes, Ma'am?

321
00:23:21,499 --> 00:23:22,374
Where's Mom?

322
00:23:22,418 --> 00:23:23,719
She hasn't arrived yet.

323
00:23:23,744 --> 00:23:25,163
Okay, thank you!

324
00:23:28,258 --> 00:23:29,217
Hello?

325
00:23:30,260 --> 00:23:31,469
Mom,

326
00:23:31,469 --> 00:23:32,971
where are you?

327
00:23:32,971 --> 00:23:34,806
<i>I'm buying a dress for tomorrow.</i>

328
00:23:34,806 --> 00:23:37,141
<i>And gifts for you and your husband.</i>

329
00:23:37,850 --> 00:23:41,047
Mom, you know the wedding is fake.

330
00:23:41,072 --> 00:23:43,074
Why are you acting like it's real?

331
00:23:43,383 --> 00:23:44,299
<i>Why?</i>

332
00:23:44,324 --> 00:23:46,869
<i>Can't I attend my daughter's wedding?</i>

333
00:23:47,472 --> 00:23:49,891
Mom, the wedding's not real!

334
00:23:50,405 --> 00:23:52,198
It was just a ploy by me and Drake.

335
00:23:53,283 --> 00:23:54,284
Wait.

336
00:23:54,909 --> 00:23:56,160
Speaking of...

337
00:23:56,491 --> 00:23:58,159
he hasn't even texted me yet.

338
00:23:59,038 --> 00:24:00,915
I haven't been able to reach him.

339
00:24:01,291 --> 00:24:03,459
<i>Well, I'm still hoping it's true.</i>

340
00:24:03,459 --> 00:24:05,545
<i>I'm doing a fitting now. Bye!</i>

341
00:24:05,545 --> 00:24:06,375
But <i>—</i>

342
00:24:09,716 --> 00:24:10,657
Annoying.

343
00:24:13,292 --> 00:24:16,670
I'm done.
All I want to do is relax.

344
00:24:19,934 --> 00:24:20,836
Who’s this?

345
00:24:23,671 --> 00:24:24,338
Hello?

346
00:24:24,606 --> 00:24:26,482
Cristine!

347
00:24:28,693 --> 00:24:30,028
What's up, honey?

348
00:24:30,028 --> 00:24:31,988
Fier, you bitch!

349
00:24:32,563 --> 00:24:35,399
Where exactly are you
here in the Philippines?

350
00:24:35,908 --> 00:24:39,329
Oh my god!
You're here in the Philippines already?

351
00:24:39,495 --> 00:24:41,032
Obviously, honey!

352
00:24:41,057 --> 00:24:43,184
I'll go to your house tomorrow, okay?

353
00:24:43,291 --> 00:24:44,917
My brothers ditched me.

354
00:24:44,942 --> 00:24:46,568
Oh god.

355
00:24:46,593 --> 00:24:48,646
The twins haven't changed.

356
00:24:48,671 --> 00:24:50,340
Still as stubborn as ever.

357
00:24:50,365 --> 00:24:51,324
I know, right?

358
00:24:51,465 --> 00:24:52,591
<i>Oh no, Fier.</i>

359
00:24:52,925 --> 00:24:54,551
<i>I have plans tomorrow.</i>

360
00:24:55,094 --> 00:24:57,305
Can we just reschedule or something?

361
00:24:57,797 --> 00:25:00,133
Hmm... where?

362
00:25:00,158 --> 00:25:01,785
What if I come with you?

363
00:25:01,810 --> 00:25:04,604
There's no one in the
house but the maids.

364
00:25:04,629 --> 00:25:08,508
And then Chance and Lourd
are out picking up girls. My god!

365
00:25:08,931 --> 00:25:10,057
Fine. Okay.

366
00:25:10,519 --> 00:25:13,313
But we're going to a
wedding tomorrow, okay?

367
00:25:13,956 --> 00:25:15,416
No naughty business.

368
00:25:16,115 --> 00:25:17,158
Me?

369
00:25:17,183 --> 00:25:18,101
Naughty?

370
00:25:18,509 --> 00:25:21,804
Remember when you attended
your long-time crush's wedding

371
00:25:21,829 --> 00:25:24,305
and you were wearing a black dress?

372
00:25:24,832 --> 00:25:26,664
<i>Fier, you're my plus one.</i>

373
00:25:26,695 --> 00:25:27,946
<i>Remember!</i>

374
00:25:28,127 --> 00:25:29,837
Fine, whatever.

375
00:25:29,837 --> 00:25:31,089
You know what? Fine.

376
00:25:31,089 --> 00:25:31,977
I'll see you.

377
00:25:32,002 --> 00:25:34,547
I'll go to sleep, so I'll be
pretty when you see me.

378
00:25:35,265 --> 00:25:36,766
Okay? Goodnight.

379
00:25:37,014 --> 00:25:37,932
Goodnight!

380
00:25:37,957 --> 00:25:38,791
See you!

381
00:25:38,925 --> 00:25:39,946
Bye bye!

382
00:25:54,678 --> 00:25:56,158
Good morning, brat!

383
00:25:57,103 --> 00:26:00,468
Mom, what is going on?

384
00:26:00,493 --> 00:26:02,745
If you just followed what I said,

385
00:26:02,745 --> 00:26:06,124
then Drake would be
my son-in-law by now!

386
00:26:06,124 --> 00:26:09,168
Mom, if you want Drake that badly...

387
00:26:09,168 --> 00:26:11,421
Go! Ask him to marry you instead.

388
00:26:13,235 --> 00:26:15,612
Aren't you gonna get ready?
It's your wedding.

389
00:26:16,016 --> 00:26:17,183
Mom, come on.

390
00:26:17,468 --> 00:26:20,972
I'm the only one going.
You're not coming with me!

391
00:26:22,557 --> 00:26:24,350
Cristine, Fier's here.

392
00:26:24,600 --> 00:26:25,935
What a pretty girl!

393
00:26:25,935 --> 00:26:28,229
Oh, how come you didn't end up
being that pretty?

394
00:26:29,731 --> 00:26:30,940
Well,

395
00:26:30,965 --> 00:26:32,383
because I'm just like you.

396
00:26:32,608 --> 00:26:33,943
Such a brat!

397
00:26:33,943 --> 00:26:35,361
Go see your friend.

398
00:26:35,862 --> 00:26:36,904
Okay.

399
00:26:36,929 --> 00:26:37,972
Fier!

400
00:26:38,117 --> 00:26:39,535
Coming!

401
00:26:42,748 --> 00:26:44,833
Who's getting married, anyway?

402
00:26:44,858 --> 00:26:45,984
Drake.

403
00:26:46,009 --> 00:26:47,219
Drake who?

404
00:26:47,629 --> 00:26:48,463
Drake Palma.

405
00:26:48,541 --> 00:26:50,710
Mmm! Sounds yummy.

406
00:26:51,836 --> 00:26:53,963
Fier!
The person is getting married.

407
00:26:53,963 --> 00:26:55,882
Would you avoid having dirty thoughts?

408
00:26:56,257 --> 00:26:57,717
If I know you,

409
00:26:57,800 --> 00:26:58,760
you like him.

410
00:26:58,760 --> 00:26:59,886
And you're sad

411
00:26:59,886 --> 00:27:01,179
because he's marrying someone else.

412
00:27:01,625 --> 00:27:02,722
Yuck!

413
00:27:03,013 --> 00:27:05,066
Can I puke right now?
My god!

414
00:27:05,099 --> 00:27:06,350
That's disgusting, Fier.

415
00:27:06,449 --> 00:27:08,493
Drake and I aren't together, okay?

416
00:27:08,811 --> 00:27:10,563
In my nightmares
maybe it could happen.

417
00:27:10,881 --> 00:27:12,257
Tell me the truth, honey.

418
00:27:12,282 --> 00:27:13,212
I know you!

419
00:27:13,394 --> 00:27:15,521
Well then, I guess you
don't know me well enough!

420
00:27:16,569 --> 00:27:18,488
Come on, tell me the truth, honey.

421
00:27:18,740 --> 00:27:21,200
- I swear—
- Whatever, let's go.

422
00:28:10,080 --> 00:28:11,873
<i>Marry me...</i>

423
00:28:11,898 --> 00:28:13,442
<i>or lose me forever.</i>

424
00:28:19,162 --> 00:28:21,080
I know you're coming.

425
00:28:21,926 --> 00:28:22,924
Please, Alys.

426
00:28:26,336 --> 00:28:28,088
What are you doing, Alys?

427
00:28:29,767 --> 00:28:31,602
You should know what
you’re supposed to do.

428
00:28:33,145 --> 00:28:34,981
You know it better than anyone.

429
00:28:48,119 --> 00:28:49,065
Drake!

430
00:28:50,496 --> 00:28:51,247
Drake,

431
00:28:51,593 --> 00:28:52,552
what happened?

432
00:28:52,615 --> 00:28:53,950
Why is there no one at the church?

433
00:28:54,584 --> 00:28:55,585
Cristine...

434
00:28:57,003 --> 00:28:58,004
My god, Drake...

435
00:28:59,763 --> 00:29:01,098
What happened?!

436
00:29:01,549 --> 00:29:03,301
You had me worried!

437
00:29:03,590 --> 00:29:05,342
No one heard anything from you!

438
00:29:05,367 --> 00:29:07,410
To Uncle Steve, not even an update.

439
00:29:07,763 --> 00:29:09,307
Please don't yell at me.

440
00:29:10,031 --> 00:29:11,949
I've been yelled at too
many times since last week.

441
00:29:20,860 --> 00:29:22,445
Drake, please.

442
00:29:25,448 --> 00:29:26,526
Just stop.

443
00:29:28,292 --> 00:29:29,460
Let's go home.

444
00:29:32,121 --> 00:29:33,289
Drake, please.

445
00:29:33,854 --> 00:29:35,105
Let's go home.

446
00:29:37,233 --> 00:29:39,443
Forget about Alys.

447
00:29:39,545 --> 00:29:40,432
Please!

448
00:29:41,539 --> 00:29:42,874
Stop this game.

449
00:29:44,634 --> 00:29:45,760
Look, mister.

450
00:29:45,760 --> 00:29:46,886
Your bride ditched you.

451
00:29:46,911 --> 00:29:47,909
Move on!

452
00:29:48,554 --> 00:29:49,495
Fier!

453
00:29:50,212 --> 00:29:51,174
What?

454
00:29:51,515 --> 00:29:52,892
I'm just saying the truth here.

455
00:29:53,960 --> 00:29:54,920
She left him!

456
00:29:55,222 --> 00:29:56,432
Move on, dude!

457
00:29:56,457 --> 00:29:58,417
The world won't stop spinning
just because she left.

458
00:29:58,442 --> 00:30:00,569
Fier, you don't know
anything about them.

459
00:30:00,628 --> 00:30:01,337
Please!

460
00:30:01,400 --> 00:30:02,318
Stop bitching!

461
00:30:02,318 --> 00:30:03,444
Dear god!

462
00:30:03,444 --> 00:30:04,528
Look, mister!

463
00:30:04,643 --> 00:30:05,769
I don't know you,

464
00:30:05,977 --> 00:30:08,563
so I can only give
an outsider's opinion.

465
00:30:08,588 --> 00:30:10,256
And from how I see it?

466
00:30:10,281 --> 00:30:11,366
She doesn't care.

467
00:30:12,745 --> 00:30:15,790
I hate it when people beg for
something that they can't have.

468
00:30:16,165 --> 00:30:17,667
You know, if you want it bad enough,

469
00:30:18,031 --> 00:30:19,449
make it happen!

470
00:30:19,701 --> 00:30:21,620
- Begging will only make you look path—
- Shut up.

471
00:30:22,880 --> 00:30:23,932
Drake!

472
00:30:27,259 --> 00:30:29,553
She's so gonna regret
letting him down.

473
00:30:30,512 --> 00:30:32,389
Could you give me
Mr. Grumpy's number?

474
00:30:33,516 --> 00:30:34,542
What?

475
00:30:35,351 --> 00:30:36,936
His number.

476
00:30:36,936 --> 00:30:37,561
Hello?

477
00:30:37,561 --> 00:30:39,313
The guy's heartbroken!

478
00:30:39,730 --> 00:30:40,862
So?

479
00:30:40,887 --> 00:30:41,888
He's single now.

480
00:30:42,897 --> 00:30:43,784
My God.

481
00:30:53,327 --> 00:30:55,329
Make sure the documents are all there.

482
00:30:55,371 --> 00:30:55,788
Yes, sir.

483
00:30:55,813 --> 00:30:56,398
Okay.

484
00:30:58,180 --> 00:30:59,002
Alys?

485
00:31:02,503 --> 00:31:03,542
Alys!

486
00:31:03,577 --> 00:31:05,120
- Uncle Tristan!
- How are you?

487
00:31:05,145 --> 00:31:05,979
- Where’s Tripp?
- How are you?

488
00:31:06,004 --> 00:31:06,901
What?

489
00:31:07,054 --> 00:31:07,963
Tripp?

490
00:31:08,282 --> 00:31:09,033
Yes, Uncle.

491
00:31:09,058 --> 00:31:09,957
Where is he?

492
00:31:10,302 --> 00:31:12,179
We haven't spoken for over a week.

493
00:31:12,179 --> 00:31:14,098
Oh my god, I didn't know!

494
00:31:14,338 --> 00:31:15,589
He's already in New York!

495
00:31:16,128 --> 00:31:17,797
Since last Tuesday.

496
00:31:18,083 --> 00:31:19,710
I thought he told you.

497
00:31:20,260 --> 00:31:21,178
New York?

498
00:31:21,813 --> 00:31:22,565
Yes.

499
00:31:24,485 --> 00:31:26,404
Our projects started picking up.

500
00:31:26,975 --> 00:31:29,019
I didn't know that

501
00:31:29,044 --> 00:31:30,879
he'd take on all of them.

502
00:31:31,193 --> 00:31:33,529
He'll be busy for a month!

503
00:31:34,251 --> 00:31:35,544
One month?!

504
00:31:35,953 --> 00:31:37,330
Yeah, one month.

505
00:31:41,015 --> 00:31:42,600
I'm really sorry, Alys.

506
00:31:43,052 --> 00:31:44,261
How about this?

507
00:31:44,286 --> 00:31:46,789
If you want, I can give you the number

508
00:31:46,814 --> 00:31:48,565
of the hotel he's staying at.

509
00:31:49,826 --> 00:31:50,854
No, that's okay, Uncle.

510
00:31:50,879 --> 00:31:51,909
Thank you.

511
00:31:51,934 --> 00:31:52,893
What? Are you sure?

512
00:31:52,970 --> 00:31:54,430
Yes, Uncle. No, thank you.

513
00:31:54,735 --> 00:31:57,321
Okay, you just take care.
I'll see you around.

514
00:31:57,391 --> 00:31:59,560
- Take care, Uncle.
- Okay, I have to go. Bye.

515
00:32:44,313 --> 00:32:45,648
Tripp...

516
00:32:46,690 --> 00:32:48,081
Please pick up.

517
00:32:51,529 --> 00:32:54,990
<i>Your call has been forwarded</i>
<i>to an automatic voice message system.</i>

518
00:32:54,990 --> 00:32:57,910
<i>At the tone, please record your message.</i>

519
00:32:58,656 --> 00:32:59,657
Tripp...

520
00:33:00,663 --> 00:33:02,748
Can we stop fighting?

521
00:33:07,920 --> 00:33:11,382
Drake gave up. Didn't you see that?

522
00:33:16,303 --> 00:33:18,088
Please don't be like this.

523
00:33:19,306 --> 00:33:21,667
Why are you being like this?

524
00:33:28,858 --> 00:33:31,110
Was I just a trophy to you?

525
00:33:34,178 --> 00:33:37,723
Did you only love me
because Drake loved me?

526
00:33:39,326 --> 00:33:42,346
And now that he's left me,
you're leaving me too?

527
00:33:46,000 --> 00:33:48,151
Tripp please, don't be like this.

528
00:34:17,615 --> 00:34:19,002
Alys!

529
00:34:21,118 --> 00:34:22,065
What?

530
00:34:23,954 --> 00:34:25,620
Hey, are you okay?

531
00:34:26,191 --> 00:34:28,526
I’m worried about you.
Even if it isn't obvious.

532
00:34:29,644 --> 00:34:31,313
What do you want, Tofer?

533
00:34:31,338 --> 00:34:32,672
Well...

534
00:34:33,297 --> 00:34:36,800
Uncle Tristan said Tripp wasn't home.

535
00:34:36,936 --> 00:34:38,938
So I thought I'd bother you instead.

536
00:34:39,261 --> 00:34:41,305
Then go follow him in New York!

537
00:34:41,330 --> 00:34:41,872
Hey.

538
00:34:41,897 --> 00:34:43,010
Why are you even here?

539
00:34:43,690 --> 00:34:44,983
Don't be so mean.

540
00:34:45,825 --> 00:34:48,077
Don't blame Marco's faults on me.

541
00:34:49,253 --> 00:34:50,745
Don't you remember?

542
00:34:51,189 --> 00:34:54,323
We're Best Friends Forever, right?

543
00:35:05,287 --> 00:35:06,455
But Alys,

544
00:35:07,456 --> 00:35:08,624
believe me...

545
00:35:09,833 --> 00:35:11,460
I get you.

546
00:35:12,726 --> 00:35:14,353
I know how it feels.

547
00:35:15,077 --> 00:35:16,871
I know what you're going through.

548
00:35:19,702 --> 00:35:21,037
BFF?

549
00:35:27,476 --> 00:35:30,020
Sorry for being moody, Tofer.

550
00:35:32,022 --> 00:35:33,102
Come on!

551
00:35:34,358 --> 00:35:35,442
Like I said,

552
00:35:35,888 --> 00:35:37,389
I get you.

553
00:35:39,772 --> 00:35:41,649
So, you want to grab some dinner?

554
00:35:41,674 --> 00:35:42,866
G! Let's go!

555
00:35:42,866 --> 00:35:44,368
Hurry up! Get on your feet!

556
00:35:44,368 --> 00:35:46,070
You're so slow. Take a bath!

557
00:35:46,095 --> 00:35:47,281
Let's go. Hurry!

558
00:35:49,373 --> 00:35:51,164
So?
Where are we going?

559
00:35:51,189 --> 00:35:52,315
Where do you want to go?

560
00:35:53,108 --> 00:35:55,986
I'm asking you because it's your call.

561
00:35:56,011 --> 00:35:57,971
Alright, fine. How about this?

562
00:35:58,268 --> 00:36:00,228
We grab an early dinner,

563
00:36:00,438 --> 00:36:01,689
and then we party after.

564
00:36:01,714 --> 00:36:03,216
